    "source": "C",
    "act_article": "ss201(c),801(d)",
    "quote": "The gross income of a resident includes all economic benefits regardless of source.",
    "additional_exact_quote": "income attributable to the permanent establishment",
    "rule": "A resident company\u2019s gross income includes worldwide economic benefits, regardless of source; a nonresident\u2019s gross income includes only Liberia-source economic benefits and is taxed under Chapter8. A nonresident\u2019s permanent establishment is treated as a resident legal person only with respect to income attributable to that establishment, with the related filing and advance-payment requirements.",
